<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <span class="badge">🎓 Belajar Ruby on Rails</span>
    <h1>Selamat Datang di <span class="highlight">RubyLearn</span></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Platform belajar Ruby on Rails yang simpel, cepat, dan menyenangkan.
      Mulai perjalananmu jadi Rails developer hari ini.
    </p>

    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <% if session[:user_id] %>
        <%= link_to "Ke Dashboard →", dashboard_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
      <% else %>
        <%= link_to "Masuk / Login", login_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
        <%= link_to "Pelajari Lebih Lanjut", "#features", class: "btn btn-secondary" %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="features" id="features">
  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon">🚀</div>
    <h3>Cepat</h3>
    <p>Materi dikemas ringkas biar kamu langsung praktik, bukan cuma teori.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon">🧩</div>
    <h3>Terstruktur</h3>
    <p>Belajar step-by-step dari dasar sampai bisa bikin project sendiri.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon">🤝</div>
    <h3>Gratis</h3>
    <p>Semua materi bisa diakses tanpa biaya, cukup login pakai akun Google.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <p>&copy; <%= Date.current.year %> RubyLearn. Dibuat dengan ❤️ untuk belajar Rails.</p>
</footer>

<style>
  .hero {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 90vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdf2f2 0%, #f5f7fa 100%);
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #fde8e8;
    color: #cc0000;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-content h1 {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: #cc0000;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background-color: #cc0000;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(204, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: #cc0000;
    border: 2px solid #cc0000;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background-color: #fde8e8;
  }

  .features {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .site-footer {
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    color: #999;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
</style>